@startuml UC6 Receipt and Shipment
title UC6: Receipt and Shipment Details Activity Diagram

start

:Payment Successfully Completed;

:Retrieve Transaction Details\nfrom Payment Service;

:Retrieve Item Details\nfrom Catalogue Service;

:Calculate Shipping Timeline\nbased on Item Shipping Days;

:Generate Unique Order ID;

:Create Receipt Record\nin Database;

:Format Receipt Data:\n- Order ID\n- Transaction ID\n- Item Name\n- Item Price\n- Shipping Type\n- Shipping Cost\n- Total Amount Paid\n- Payment Method\n- Transaction Date;

:Format Shipping Data:\n- Recipient Name\n- Shipping Address\n- Estimated Delivery\n  ("Ships in X days")\n- Tracking (TBD);

:Send Email Receipt\nto User's Email Address;

:Display Receipt and\nShipment Page:\n- Order Summary\n- Payment Details\n- Shipping Info;

:Provide Options:\n- Print Receipt\n- Download PDF\n- Return to Home;

:User Selects Action;

switch (Action?)
case (Print Receipt)
  :Open Browser Print Dialog;
case (Download PDF)
  :Generate PDF File & Download;
case (Return Home)
  :Navigate to Home Page;
endswitch

:Log Transaction Completion\nin Audit Trail;

:Update User's Order History;

:Notify Seller:\n"Item Sold"\n"Payment Received";

stop

@enduml
